error[Z0401]: `a` and `b` agree on every pair, so `mcnemar_test` has no pairs that differ to form its statistic from
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:49
  |
1 | frame(a = [1, 1, 0, 0, 1], b = [1, 1, 0, 0, 1]).mcnemar_test(a, b)
  |                                                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^ no pairs that differ
  |
  = help: the two proportions are equal in these rows; `method: exact` gives the p-value of that, 1

