error[Z0401]: `correct` of `mcnemar_test` must be a Bool, but this is an Int
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:71
  |
1 | frame(a = [1, 0, 1, 0], b = [1, 0, 0, 1]).mcnemar_test(a, b, correct: 1)
  |                                                                       ^ an Int
  |
  = help: usage: `data.mcnemar_test(a, b, correct: Bool = true, method: chi2 | exact = chi2, weights: Var, weight_type: frequency | analytic | sampling = sampling)`

